msgid ""
"Trace and Immunize Gujranwala is a government digital health platform under "
"the District Health Authority, designed to modernize vaccination services "
"and improve healthcare accessibility."
msgstr ""
"ٹریس اینڈ امیونائز گوجرانوالہ ضلعی محکمہ صحت کے تحت ایک سرکاری ڈیجیٹل صحت "
